<https://duyhxm.github.io/skg-ontology/core> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Core ontology for scholarly knowledge graph data aligned with Dublin Core, Schema.org, FOAF, FaBiO, SKOS, PROV-O, and CiTO while preserving RDF-Star innovation patterns."@en .
<https://duyhxm.github.io/skg-ontology/core> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://duyhxm.github.io/skg-ontology/core> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Core TBox for multi-venue scholarly graph generation. Uses standard predicates where possible and preserves RDF-Star edge annotation patterns for provenance and confidence."@en .
<https://duyhxm.github.io/skg-ontology/core> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "6.0.0" .
